The blocks of an accordion panel have insert points between them, an "Add a block" control at the end of the panel, and a toolbar with Move up, Move down and a "Block actions" menu (Duplicate, Delete with Undo, and "Turn into"). Inside a panel, the slash menu only offers the blocks a panel can hold, and notes that accordions can't be nested. Alt+Shift+↑ and ↓ move the block that holds the caret. @Humanaice
